{"game": "risk-of-rain-2", "language": "english", "appid": 632360, "month": "2019-05", "window": 3, "start_date": 1557964800, "end_date": 1558655999, "month_true_total": 1429, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-13 02:41:41 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "50791446", "author": {"steamid": "76561198202238762", "personaname": "Mgalekgolo", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198202238762/", "num_games_owned": 146, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 5099, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 665, "last_played": 1784392286, "avatar": "ed56211970e24f6ec8da62fe64bcb36e7bee1d8c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Amazing and addictive game with potential. But the online multiplayer need a lot of work since you will constantly disconnected 99% percent of the time making it online feature broken.", "timestamp_created": 1558650195, "timestamp_updated": 1558650195, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "50791404", "author": {"steamid": "76561198025550116", "personaname": "The_Texan_Wookiee", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/aflipp/", "num_games_owned": 360, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 830, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 56, "last_played": 1644980316, "avatar": "b93f04b9194fba8980a2dc74947d47d0087ba113"}, "language": "english", "review": "A friend gave me a copy as a gift and he highly recommended it. I've only played for about an hour but I have to agree with him. Straightforward game play, go around the level finding as many power-ups, chests, and drones as possible while defeating hoards of enemies. The controls are nice and tight, simple. The graphics seem to be very simple and that's part of the appeal. This brings me to my only major complaint: CPU temps. This game tends to run my CPU to temps above anything else I run. The Division 2, AC:Origins, Apex Legends, Overwatch, and all of my VR games don't run my temps up as high as this game does. I don't understand why.\n\nEDIT: They seem to have fixed the CPU temp problem, temps are now perfectly normal and in acceptable ranges. Also, they keep adding more and more content (for FREE!) and that's pretty great. I'm waiting for the game to go on sale so that I can buy my son a copy and we can play together.", "timestamp_created": 1558649988, "timestamp_updated": 1582986358, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.513513505458831787", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "50791217", "author": {"steamid": "76561198076371668", "personaname": "Velignis", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198076371668/", "num_games_owned": 175, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 9577, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1914, "last_played": 1725138734, "avatar": "95b16501143dfd6af39a1a55e63a605948fded58"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game overall, all the time I've spent playing so far has been solo and I can only imagine how good it is on co-op. Be mindful however that it is very early access as of this review and if it feels like there's not alot of content, more is coming soon, the next major update is a month away and 3 more should be after it within the next year.", "timestamp_created": 1558648826, "timestamp_updated": 1558648826, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, 